# Model ONNX besar TIDAK di-commit (99-200MB melebihi batas GitHub).
# Diunduh + dibundle saat build via task bundleBubbleModel / bundleLamaModel.
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.pt
*.bin

# Keystore + password JANGAN di-push ke repo publik. CI memakai keystore debug
# bawaan AGP. Contoh: salin signing.properties ke lokal saja, jangan commit.
app/signing.properties
app/keystores/
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
google-services.json
